#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:114
#: c4c6243727ed4cb9a95f9c3c93e4cbee
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:116
#: 5b10cff86b5e4ff6909265207da30d10
msgid "All motor/servo outputs 1-10 are Dshot, Bi-Directional DShot, and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:118
#: 2207adfc97b847a88c7180f033ff6bc0
msgid "The output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6/9/10, 7/8. Outputs 11/12 (SE1/SE2) and 13 (LED) are in separate groups and are not Dshot capable."
msgstr ""

